{"resourceIdentifier":"1881","resourceName":"Conservation of Panama Forests - Reduction of GHG Emissions from Deforestation. Grouped Project","description":"The project area for the first instance consists of mature and secondary forest areas (8,024.97 ha). It extends throughout Panama's geography being present in seven provinces: Bocas del Toro, Chiriquí, Coclé, Colón, Panama, Los Santos and Veraguas. The project has the potential to reduce 171,697 tons of CO2 during the 10-year first fixed baseline period, with an average annual reduction of 17,170 tons of CO2 per year (for this first instance), through the implementation of activities aimed at reducing deforestation.","location":{"latitude":9.100438,"longitude":-82.629878},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-04-06","endExclusive":"2020-05-07","endInclusive":"2020-05-06"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1881"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Coclé Colón Panama Los Santos Veraguas Chiriqui"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Panamanian Pro Carbon Association (Asociación Panameña Pro Carbono. Approcarbono)"},{"type":"string","value":"China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 10 63887060"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"17170"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0015"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"8024 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DA